  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3117.08 Suspension or Revocation of Approved CDL Driving School License. The suspension or revocation of a CDL driving school license shall be in accordance with Saf-C 3108.10.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3121.08) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
